# The build context is the repo root (the API image needs packages/shared source), but the repo is
# ~414MB of which ~407MB is node_modules and only ~3MB is actual source. Excluding node_modules is
# by far the highest-value line here — it also stops the host's darwin-arm64 Prisma engine from
# being copied into a linux image.
# 构建上下文是仓库根目录（API 镜像需要 packages/shared 的源码），但仓库 414MB 里
# 407MB 是 node_modules，真实源码只有约 3MB。排除 node_modules 是这里性价比最高的一条，
# 它同时防止宿主机的 darwin-arm64 Prisma 引擎被拷进 linux 镜像。
**/node_modules

# Local build artifacts — apps/web/dist and dist-singlefile both exist on disk right now.
# 本地构建产物——apps/web/dist 和 dist-singlefile 目前都存在于磁盘上
**/dist
**/dist-singlefile
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets. Four .env files currently exist on disk; none may enter the image.
# In production these values are injected at runtime from Render's environment settings,
# never baked into the image.
# 密钥。磁盘上现有 4 个 .env 文件，一个都不能进镜像。
# 生产环境这些值由 Render 的环境变量在运行时注入，绝不烤进镜像。
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store
*.log

# Not needed at runtime. The frontend is deployed separately to Vercel, so nothing under
# apps/web or packages/engine is part of this image.
# 运行时用不到。前端单独部署到 Vercel，所以 apps/web 和 packages/engine 下的内容
# 都不属于这个镜像。
docs
README.md
README.en.md
docker-compose.yml
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
render.yaml
vercel.json

# Leftover local sqlite (already in .gitignore, belt and braces here)
# 本地 sqlite 残留（.gitignore 里已有，这里再兜一层）
apps/api/prisma/migrations/dev.db*
